1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,500
For twenty years, Meena has kept
every health report she was ever given.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:15,500
Every visit, her doctor searches the pile,
page after page, for one old value.

3
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Most AI tools fix that by sending
her private data far outside the hospital.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:31,500
VitaGraph is different. It reads
every page, even the old scanned ones.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:39,500
Then it connects every result,
from every year, into one clear picture.

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,800
Ask in plain English,
and the answer points

7
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:47,500
to the exact line,
on the exact page.

8
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,800
No guessing. No diagnosis.
Just her own facts.

9
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:56,000
It runs on open models
inside your hospital. Nothing leaves.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,500
VitaGraph: answers you can check.
